      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d708a5cc",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person in a purple wizard costume holding a wand and a book, standing against a red checkered background. The text overlay reads: 'remember no matter how much you whine like a little bitch, trump is still your president.' The overall intent is to mock and dismiss political opponents or critics of Donald Trump by portraying them as petty or unreasonable, while asserting Trump's continued authority. This meme uses a combination of visual and textual elements to convey a message of political defiance and to discourage dissent. The use of the term 'little bitch' is abusive and demeaning, targeting individuals who criticize Trump, and the overall tone is hostile and dismissive. The meme is harmful because it promotes a culture of disrespect and discourages constructive dialogue, potentially inciting further division and hostility. The intent is to reinforce loyalty to Trump and to undermine the legitimacy of opposition voices, using the wizard costume as a humorous or ironic visual metaphor to contrast the seriousness of political power with the absurdity of the situation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5ffae2f1"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
